                "1": {
                    "ID": "9381629",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/425672-/episodes/9381629",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Squishy Airune",
                        "jpn": "ぷにっとあいるん♪"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Punirunes and Airune, who are full of curiosity, live with Yuka, a girl in the fourth grade of elementary school. Today, too, I'm very happy to have Punipuni's \"Appunipai\" made.\r\n\r\nThen I heard Yuka's dad screaming. Papa is troubled because he can't think of new bread ideas. Yuka's house is a local bakery.\r\n\r\nAirun immediately calls her friend Punirunzu and starts coming up with ideas for bread. But it's just funny...",
                        "jpn": "好奇心旺盛なぷにるんず・あいるんは、小学４年生の女の子・ゆかと一緒にくらしている。今日も、ぷにぷにの『あっぷにぱい』を作ってもらい大満足のあいるん。\r\n\r\nすると、ゆかのパパの叫び声が聞こえてきた。新しいパンのアイディアが浮かばずに悩んでいるパパ。ゆかの家は、町のパン屋さんなのだ。\r\n\r\nさっそく友だちのぷにるんずを呼び、みんなでパンのアイディアを考え始めるあいるん。でも、それはおかしなものばかりで……。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
                "2": {
                    "ID": "9382229",
                    "TYPE": null,
                    "URL": "https://www.thetvdb.com/series/425672-/episodes/9382229",
                    "Titles": {
                        "eng": "Growth of a Babyrune",
                        "jpn": "べびるん、成長するん♪"
                    },
                    "Summaries": {
                        "eng": "Yuka's best friend Aoi has changed her blood phase.\r\nShe picked up Punirunzu's baby \"Bevirun\", but she didn't know what to do, so she came to Yuka for advice.\r\nShe teaches Yuka Airun how to take care of Aoi Nippon Punirunzu, such as taking a bath, eating, and puffing.\r\nThen Bebilun grew into Kiirun.\r\nShe takes care of Aoi in the same way, but for some reason she doesn't get used to listening to him.\r\nAoi begins her special training with Yuka and Airun, but...",
                        "jpn": "ゆかのところに、親友のあおいが血相を変えてやってきた。\r\nぷにるんずの赤ちゃん『べびるん』をひろったのだが、どうしていいかわからず、ゆかに相談に来たらしい。\r\nお風呂やごはん、ぷっきんぐなど、あおいにぷにるんずのお世話の仕方を教えるゆかとあいるん。\r\nすると、べびるんは、『きいるん』へと成長した。\r\nあおいも同じようにお世話をするが、なぜかきいるんはなつかない。\r\nゆかとあいるんのもと、特訓を開始するあおいだが……。"
                    },
                    "Aliases": []
                },
